WEBVTT

00:08:56.966 --> 00:09:00.268
ambayo itaenda kufuatilia safari
kuwa miji ya Scotland

00:09:00.292 --> 00:09:05.119
na Uphilipino
na Colombia inakwenda pamoja.

00:09:05.537 --> 00:09:06.760
Kuona kinachofanikiwa,

00:09:06.784 --> 00:09:10.411
kuchukua kile kilichotayarisha
kutekelezwa katika nchi nzima

00:09:10.435 --> 00:09:12.172
na kuiweka chini kwa ngazi ya jiji,

00:09:12.196 --> 00:09:13.354
ambapo tunaamini

00:09:13.378 --> 00:09:16.791
kwamba tunaweza kufanya maendeleo
ya haraka na ya kuonekana

00:09:16.815 --> 00:09:18.776
katika muda mfupi.

00:09:18.800 --> 00:09:19.982
Na tunapofanya hivyo,

00:09:20.006 --> 00:09:23.029
mafanikio hayo yatashirikishwa
kupitia maabara ya mafunzo na zaidi

00:09:23.053 --> 00:09:24.653
katika Chuo kikuu cha Edinburgh.

00:09:26.728 --> 00:09:28.696
Kutokomeza ukatili ni jambo sahihi,

00:09:28.720 --> 00:09:30.744
ni uwekezaji makini,